      "title": "Arts Cultural Development Officer Type Full-time Duration 3 months Salary $101,985 to $110,964 Reporting to the Senior Coordinator Community & Cultural Programming, you will be responsible for supporting the investigation, development and delivery of innovative creative programs, events and services to ensure quality cultural development outcomes for our Boroondara community. Application close Thu 28 May 2026 View job details",
      "url": "https://career10.successfactors.com/sfcareer/jobreqcareer?jobId=15084&company=cityofboroP",
      "first_seen_at": "2026-05-28T07:07:46Z",
