details Waste Driver / Attendant Type Full-time Duration Ongoing Salary $90,430 per year (plus superannuation) We are seeking Waste Driver / Attendant to work in our Waste Operations team, which is located at the Boroondara Waste and Recycling Centre operated by the City of Boroondara. The team is responsible for weekday collection of hard, household, recyclable and organic waste. Our team members enjoy a variety of work in densely populated residential areas and in a very busy operational work site. If you have experience in the Waste industry, we welcome your application. Application close Sun 17 May 2026 View job details Casual School Crossing Supervisor Type Casual Duration Casual Position Salary $42.11 per hour, includes 25% casual loading, plus superannuation We are inviting expressions of interest from people who may be suitable for future School Crossing Supervisor opportunities. While this is not an active recruitment process, it enables Council to identify suitable candidates for future opportunities as they arise across the municipality. Application close Tue 30 June 2026 View job details Casual Maternal and Child Health (MCH) Nurse Type Casual Duration Casual Salary $61.82 to $66.58 plus 25% loading per hour Casual MCH Nurses required Application close Thu 31 December 2026 View job details School Crossing Supervisor Type Part-time Duration Ongoing Salary $11,125 per year (plus super) Become an appreciated Council employee — we value diversity, inclusion, belonging, feedback and continuous improvement. Help students and families cross the road safely during peak school times. Application close Tue 30 June 2026 View job details Child pages Was this page helpful? Yes No 8 Inglesby Road, Camberwell, Victoria 3124 (opens in a new window) The City of Boroondara acknowledges the Wurundjeri Woi-wurrung people as the Traditional Owners and original custodians of this land, and we pay our respects to their Elders past and present. Facebook (opens in a new window) 