      "title": "Transfer Station Attendant Operator Type Full-time Duration Ongoing Salary $86,472 (plus super) We are seeking an Attendant Operator to work in our Transfer Station and Yard Maintenance team, which is located at the Boroondara Waste and Recycling Centre. The team is responsible for the receiving, organising and cartage of hard, household, recyclable and organic waste. Our team members enjoy variety of work in a very busy operational work site which is open 7 days a week. Application close Sun 7 June 2026 View job details",
