      "advertised_salary_text": "Working at Merri-bek Skip to content Arrow right Chevron right Alert triangle Arrow right Chevron down Circle chevron right Clock Filter Close Info List view Location pin Search Ticket Users Wheelchair Bus Calendar Circle chevron right Credit card File text Frown Close Loader Tick Trash Users Our sites: Active Merri-bek Conversations Merri-bek Love Merri-bek, Buy Local Zero Carbon Merri-bek Search Merri-bek MENU CLOSE Living in Merri-bek Rates Pay your rates Understand your rates and waste charge Property valuations Pensioner rebates Change your details Late rates payments Waste and recycling Bins and collection services A to Z guide to waste and recycling Reducing waste Recycling stations Waste and recycling locations Clean streets and neighbourhoods Animals and pets Pet registration Pet ownership Pet desexing Problems with pets and wild animals Lost and found pets Keeping multiple pets Animal management fines Dog parks and amenities Community services Children and families Youth Child Safety and Wellbeing Older people People with a disability Diversity Public health and wellbeing Get involved Glenroy Community Hub Environment Trees Climate change Water Gardening and food production Weed control Nature Parking and roads Parking permits and fines Roads, footpaths, drains and lighting Nature strips Exploring Merri-bek Events What's on Venues Festivals and major events Submit an event listing Planning an event Sponsorship of Festivals and Events Play streets and street parties Arts Merri-bek About Arts Merri-bek What's on from Arts Merri-bek Festivals and major events Counihan Gallery Artists programs and supports Public art and collections Follow Arts Merri-bek Libraries Library services Library activities and events Library catalogue Borrow Children and young people Learn Library spaces Join the library Transport Public transport Riding a bike and walking Driving in Merri-bek Parks and gardens Park amenities and equipment Find a park