 employees will be required to hold a current Employee Working with Children Check, with the Mornington Peninsula Shire registered as an employer prior to their commencement. Some roles may also have minimum physical requirements. The preferred candidates for each role will be directed to a secure and confidential portal to make the mandatory declaration as part of the employment screening process. View our current employment opportunities . If you do not have access to a computer, please address your cover letter together with a current resume and post to: People and Culture Mornington Peninsula Shire Private Bag 1000 Rosebud VIC 3939 For more information, please email jobs@mornpen.vic.gov.au or contact us on 1300 850 600 or 5950 1000. Back to top Contact Us Mornington Peninsula Shire Private Bag 1000 Rosebud, Victoria, 3939 Email: customerservice@mornpen.vic.gov.au Phone: 1300 850 600 Service centre and connection point operating hours and days vary by location. Service Centres Rosebud Office 90 Besgrove Street, Rosebud Mornington Office 2 Queen Street, Mornington Hastings Office 21 Marine Parade, Hastings Connection Points Somerville 1085 Frankston-Flinders Road, Somerville Dromana 359B Point Nepean Road, Dromana Red Hill 137 Shoreham Road, Red Hill Sorrento 860–868 Melbourne Road, Sorrento Visit our Other Sites MP Regional Gallery Our Library Mount Martha Public Golf Course MP Business Arts and Culture Volunteering Mornington Peninsula Share & Connect Like us on Facebook Check out our Instagram Watch our YouTube videos Sign-up to our email bulletins Acknowledgement Mornington Peninsula Shire acknowledges and pays respect to the Bunurong people, the Traditional Custodians of these lands and waters. We welcome and include Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander, LGBTIQA+, and multicultural community members of all ages and abilities. Disclaimer and Copyright | Privacy Statement | Terms and Conditions | Accessibility © 2026 Mornington Peninsula Shire | Powered by Gra