rams. To be eligible for one of these positions you will require Qualifications Essential A current driver licence with HC endorsement. Employee working with children check. Experience Essential Experience in the operation of large trucks under a broad range of conditions. Key selection criteria 1 Basic mechanical knowledge. Key selection criteria 2 Basic written and verbal skills. Applications that fail to address the above key selection criteria will not be considered for this position. For more information A full position description, the key selection criteria and information on how to apply can be found in the information package, or by requesting a copy from customer service on 1300 656 564. For further information about the position or duties involved, please contact Richard Horton, Works Coordinator on 0428 087 356 or richard.horton@moyne.vic.gov.au Postal applications Confidential – Truck Driver - Sealing People and Culture Coordinator Moyne Shire Council PO Box 51 Port Fairy VIC 3284 Applications Applications for this position close 10:00 AM, 01 June 2026 Moyne Shire Council is committed to the principles of Equal Employment Opportunity Apply Now Email this job Share Email Print Back to top Contact us Moyne Shire Council Princes Street, Port Fairy, Victoria, 3284, Australia View Map Tel: 1300 656 564 PO Box 51, Princes Street, Port Fairy, Victoria 3284 Email: moyne@moyne.vic.gov.au Visit our other sites Corangamite Moyne Libraries Port Fairy Caravan Parks Moyne NextGen Moyne Webmail Share and connect Facebook Instagram LinkedIn YouTube Subscribe to our e-news Disclaimer and copyright | Privacy statement | Sitemap | Acknowledgement to the Traditional Owners © 2026 Moyne Shire Council | Powered by Granicus",
