yee Experience Employee Experience Mobile app Roll work, pay, savings, and benefits into one employee superapp Learning management A huge library of vetted courses tailored to your business needs Benefits & perks Big-business benefits on an SME budget Earned Wage Access Give your team instant access to their pay, as soon as they earn it FEATURED Employment done for you Payday Super LEARN Resources Blogs Newsroom Webinars See Pricing See all products About us Industry solutions Integrations Support AI Employment Operating System Our AI Commitment Chevron Icon Menu Employment OS for Partners Help your clients save time, stay compliant and work easy. Become a Partner Hr & Payroll Partners HR & Payroll Partners Join the partner network Explore HR and Payroll partnership opportunities for your business Referral partners Get rewarded for referring Employment Hero solutions Certified partners Own the sale, onboarding and support of Employment OS with your customers Strategic Partners Strategic Partners Become a strategic partner Build a high-impact partnership with Employment Hero Superannuation partners Streamline your super services with Embedded Super Partner Resources Partner Resources Partner directory Streamline payroll, HR and more with our trusted business partners Learning See how our partners solve employment for their clients FEATURED Hero Foundation Supporting people into work Resources See Pricing About Employment Hero Industry solutions Integrations Hero Foundation Chevron Icon Menu Employment OS for Employees See how Employment Operating System can supercharge work Learn more Download the app Manage Your Work Work Management Work admin Leave requests, timesheets, money and work perks, all in one easy app Connect with your team Celebrate wins, shoutout your teammates and stay across updates Learning & development Complete critical training, set personal goals and grow your career Employee Perks Employee Perks Earned Wage Access Access your money as soon as you’ve earned it. No more waiting for payday Discounts & offers Save on essentials and earn cashback on day-to-day spending Employee Assistance Program Build wellness at work with our Employee Assistance Program From Anywhere From Anywhere Employment Hero work app Download the app to manage work, pay and perks on the go Desktop login Manage HR tasks, training and work admin from the web FEATURED Download the app Download today and start saving Resources Support Chevron Icon Menu Employment OS for Job Seekers See how Employment Operating System can supercharge jobs Find a Job Find a job Find Your Next Role Find Your Next Role Find a job Explore open roles and find work faster with job matching Prep For Your Next Role Prep for Your Next Role Benchmark your salary See how much you should be getting paid with real-time salary insights Job hunting tips and tricks Make finding work easier with these resources, videos and interviews Resources Support Request a demo Complete the form and we’ll call you back 1300 084 847 Hero Foundation is an ACNC Registered Charity and Public Benevolent Institution Home Hero Foundation Employment shouldn’t have barriers. We’re here to change that. At the Hero Foundation, we want to break down the barriers that stop people from accessing meaningful work and change the system for the future. We’re supported by Employment Hero, one of the world’s leading employment platforms with a network of 350,000+ businesses looking to hire great people. Partner with the Foundation We partner with community organisations Charities, not-for-profits, RTOs, and community training providers that run employment readiness programmes to support people into the workforce. Partner with us To support job seekers If you face barriers to finding work, the Hero Foundation can support you into employment by highlighting you to our network of 350,000 businesses and providing one on one interview coaching. Get support And connect them with employers If you’re a business looking to hire, we connect you with motivated, trained candidates you might not otherwise discover. Hire foundation candidates With a focus on the care sector We support candidates from a wide range of backgrounds, but are currently focused on care. Run a business or employability programme in aged care, disability support, or the NDIS sector? We want to hear from you. Our work in the care sector What is the Hero Foundation? The Hero Foundation is the charitable arm of Employment Hero, using our platform, network, and reach to open up real employment opportunities for people who would otherwise be overlooked by traditional recruitment systems. We are an ACNC registered charity with Deductible Gift Recipient Item 1 status. All Hero Foundation services are free for the people who use them. Partner with the Foundation Our impact so far 11 People placed into work so far $500k Salaries secured by our candidates 400,000+ Employers in our network 400+ Candidates supported Learn how SEQUAL worked with the Hero Foundation to hire 2 incredible support workers. Partner with the Foundation How Hero Foundation makes its mark Hero Foundation’s work sits across four connected pillars: preparing candidates, enabling employers, making the right matches, and advocating for a more inclusive system. Each one is essential — and together, they’re what makes sustainable employment outcomes possible at scale. Candidate readiness and support We work with our referral partners to ensure candidates are genuinely ready to enter the workforce. That means coaching, confidence building, soft skills development, mock interviews, and application support — so that when the right opportunity comes, they’re ready to dive in. Employer enablement and inclusive hiring We use Employment Hero’s reach to get more businesses thinking differently about who they hire. Through simple resources, real stories, and hands-on support, we show why looking beyond the usual talent pool isn’t just the right thing to do — it’s good for business. And we give employers the confidence and tools to actually do it, not just talk about it. Employment matching What makes this work is the tech behind the Employment Hero platform. We use it to match candidates with the right roles, flag their applications so employers don’t miss them, and actively put strong candidates in front of businesses that are already open to hiring from our network. That’s what lets us do this at scale. Advocacy and systemic change We’re not just focused on individual placements: we want to promote inclusive hiring as a key source of talent for all businesses. We amplify our candidates’ stories and experiences, contribute to industry and public conversations, and use every placement to show the system can work differently. Our goal is to open up more opportunities and create change along the way. Featured Partners Accelerated training and bootcamps for high-demand jobs. Trauma-informed digital skills training, mentoring, and pathways to flexible employment. Advances gender equity through memberships, advocacy, and career programs. Supports financial independence through loans, training, and job placement. Ready to work with the Foundation? Get in touch Closing the gap between great candidates and great employers COMMUNITY ORGANISATIONS Refer your participants Learn more EMPLOYERS Hire from our network Learn more JOB SEEKERS Find your next role Learn more Help everyone find meaningful work Whether you’re an employer looking to hire, an organisation looking to refer candidates, or someone who wants to support the Foundation’s work, we’d love to hear from you. Register your interest We would love to hear from you – whether your organisation wants to get involved or you simply want to learn more. Complete this form and we will reach out to you shortly Company About us Careers Become a partner Media Centre Newsroom Hero Foundation Get in Touch Contact Us Sales HR Login Support Service Centre Help Centre Implementation Hub 