      "closing_text": "Job Details - School Crossing Supervisor - Yarra City Council Already Applied? Update your details, view your application and progress >> Login Job search e.g. \"Administrator, Melbourne\" Refine search Work type Casual 1 Locations Melbourne 1 Categories Community 1 School Crossing Supervisor Apply now Job no: 496888 Work type: Casual Location: Melbourne Categories: Community School Crossing Supervisor Casual | Band 1A +25% - $38.22 P/H + Industry Allowance + Super Location: Across the City of Yarra Help keep children and families safe on their way to and from school! Yarra City Council is looking for friendly and reliable people to join our team as School Crossing Supervisors. This is a great casual job for anyone who enjoys being outdoors, wants flexible hours, and is passionate about helping the community. About the Job Casual position: around 1 hour in the morning and/or afternoon, school days only Up to 10 hours per week, 2 hours per day maximum Help children and families cross the road safely at school crossings Be a friendly face in your local neighbourhood Work as part of a supportive and inclusive team What You Need A strong sense of responsibility and care for child safety Be punctual and reliable Good communication skills Basic understanding of road safety rules Access to your own vehicle or public transport and a smartphone Willingness to travel to different crossings in the Yarra area Ability to follow safety procedures Why Join Yarra City Council? Work with a supportive and inclusive team Access to training and professional development Employee Assistance Program for personal and work support -covering employment, legal, money, lifestyle and career-based topics A great entry point to gain experience in local government Before You Start: Show your right to work in Australia Complete a Police Check, Working with Children Check, and Pre-employment medical assessment Pre-employment checks are not used by Yarra City Council to prevent any applicant from applying for this position. Each application will be considered on its merits. Ready to Make a Difference? If you’re friendly, reliable and want to give back to your community, we’d love to hear from you! For further information see the position description or contact: Crystal Tran, Team Leader Compliance Administration Team on (03) 9205 5555. 100794 - School Crossing Supervisor - Position Description (July 2025).pdf Upload your Resume to apply via the application form. Apply anytime – this Expression Of Interest remains open year-round. Additional Information This position is subject to satisfactory Police Check, Working with Children Check and pre employment medical (Vision & Audiometry) prior to commencement. Pre-employment checks are not used by Yarra City Council to prevent any applicant from applying for this position. Each application will be considered on its merits. At Yarra Every Job is a Climate Job! Acting on the climate emergency requires that we change the way we think, make decisions, and prioritise action. We must embed proactive climate responses in the ways we govern, live our lives, and conduct our work. Every choice we make today and into the future will have an impact; this is true for Council and the community. Acknowledging the scale of this crisis, at Yarra we are committed to ensuring that every job is a climate job meaning that each staff member will play a key role in shaping our climate response. Yarra's Commitment to Diversity Yarra City Council is committed to being a child safe organisation and supports flexible and accessible working arrangements for all. This includes people with a disability, Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islanders, culturally, religiously and linguistically diverse people, young people, older people, women, and people who identify as gay, lesbian, bisexual, transgender, intersex or queer. We draw pride and strength from our diversity, remain open to new approaches and actively foster an inclusive workplace that celebrates the contribution made by all our people. Advertised: 11 Aug 2026 AUS Eastern Standard Time Applications close: Back to search results Apply now Refer a friend Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Search results Position Location Closes School Crossing Supervisor Melbourne Yarra City Council is looking for friendly and reliable people to join our team as School Crossing Supervisors. Expression of interest Loading... Current opportunities Position Location Closes School Crossing Supervisor Melbourne Yarra City Council is looking for friendly and reliable people to join our team as School Crossing Supervisors. Powered by PageUp IE=edge,chrome=1 School Crossing Supervisor website Yarra City Council Yarra City Council is looking for friendly and reliable people to join our team as School Crossing Supervisors.",
