g Manager on the job ad. You can also connect with our Talent Acquisition team at careers@yarraranges.vic.gov.au . Apply for a job View current vacancies and learn how to apply for a job at Yarra Ranges Council. Our organisation Learn about our organisation structure. Employee benefits - Why work at Yarra Ranges Council Learn about what it's like to work for Yarra Ranges Council, hear from our employees, and access our Enterprise Agreement. Share Facebook X Email Print Back to top Contact us Yarra Ranges Shire Council P.O. Box 105, Anderson Street Lilydale, VIC 3140 P 1300 368 333 E mail@yarraranges.vic.gov.au Connect Like us on Facebook Watch our Youtube channel Subscribe to our newsletter Acknowledgement of Country Yarra Ranges Council acknowledges the Wurundjeri and other Kulin Nation peoples as the Traditional Owners and Custodians of these lands and waterways. We pay our respects to all Elders, past, present, and emerging,who have been,and always will be, integral to the story of our region. We proudly share custodianship to care for Country together. Disclaimer & Copyright | Privacy Statement | Terms & Conditions | Social Media | Data Charter | Customer Commitment | Sitemap | Accessibility | | Translation disclaimer | | © 2026 Yarra Ranges Council | Powered by Granicus Investing in the Upper Yarra Family Centre The Upper Yarra Family Centre will be undergoing essential roof replacement works to maintain the building’s safety and structural integrity. To make sure services can continue with minimal disruption, all programs and activities will be temporarily relocated to nearby Yarra Junction Council buildings from 7 April 2026. Learn more about the relocation of services on our website Announcement equals Applications are now open Applications are now open for the infringement refund scheme. Check your eligibility and make sure you are able to provide all required information before applying. Announcement equals equals We’re currently experiencing a high volume